{
  "about": "Settings for sending orders to Printify, a print-on-demand service. Only used when FULFILLMENT is set to printify in Netlify. For each garment, models lists the Printify garments to look for, best first: the same SanMar blank the site shows when Printify carries it, then close substitutes. A number pins a Printify blueprint id. placement sizes the lettering as a share of the print area's width. Each city gets the same blank color the site shows when the garment matches by name, otherwise the closest one. colors gives rough screen colors for blank names that aren't SanMar's, used only for that match. closeEnough is the largest color difference (CIEDE2000) still counted as a match. heatherPenalty makes solid blanks win close calls. preferred sets a starting blank for a city when the math picks the wrong color family. Pick a different blank for any city in the admin screen.",
